      "writtenOn": "2021-10-07T18:33:46Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It should look identical as it does today if you connect to the PTY exported by EC-3PO (i.e. the one returned by `dut-control ec_uart_pty`). I don\u0027t think we do any error handling for responses (at least the packed plaintext).",
      "parentUuid": "e8506d88_84d436dd",
      "revId": "d49fcfc6ab2b1b85c6c5689c48baf2949046b527",
